  "commit_message": "dependency: upgrade tar to 7.5.21 to address CVE-2026-59873 (#34335)\n\n* chore: upgrade tar to 7.5.21 to address CVE-2026-59873\n\nUpgrades the `tar` dependency from 6.2.1 (deprecated) to 7.5.21 in the\nroot and @packages/server to remediate the critical DoS advisory\nGHSA-23hp-3jrh-7fpw. tar@7 removed the deprecated `tar.Parse` alias, so\nthe streaming bundle extractor now uses `tar.Parser`.\n\nAddresses #34333\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/c",
